B.Tv=s(["\ud83e\udde0","Jev mode \u2014 a local decider on the Mac","Normal = the LLM decides, exactly as v1. Jev = a small local model decides closed choices in about 45 ms; low confidence falls back to the LLM. Until your labels are applied Jev runs in shadow (logged only)."],t.s)
B.UH=s(["\ud83d\udcf1","Secure phone approvals","Pair this phone once (Approvals \u25b8 Pair), compare the fingerprint on the Mac and tap Trust. Approve / Reject is signed on the phone, encrypted for the Mac and usable once \u2014 the Anchor only relays ciphertext."],t.s)
B.QW=s(["\ud83d\udd10","Security fixes","The online Anchor now really enforces its key. Web and phone sign in with your Manage login + the one-time code from the Mac (as in v1); no key is inside this app. Keys and passwords were rotated at cutover."],t.s)
B.T1=s(["\ud83d\udcc4","Paper","Paper v2 (provisional numbers \u2014 pending your labels), the paper v1 submission, figures and results tables are in the desktop app's Paper tab (the files live on the Mac)."],t.s)
B.Us=s(["\ud83e\uddf0","One folder, two commands","Everything lives in Odin-Orchestrator-v2: one command for the environment, one for production. Any failed check stops a deploy."],t.s)
